Purpose

BTC Brain Ops is the Runtime Truth Platform of the BTC Ecosystem.

It is responsible for collecting, preserving and serving production runtime facts.

Brain Ops is NOT responsible for engineering conclusions.

Brain Ops is NOT responsible for trading decisions.

Brain Ops never modifies production behaviour.

⸻

Core Philosophy

Separate Facts from Conclusions.

Runtime systems collect facts.

Engineering systems produce conclusions.

Production systems execute decisions.

